{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_fireball","model_identifier":"spell_fireball","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_fireball\n\nBattle-mage fireball: an orange-yellow core in a red shell (12 u), flying along -Z. Origin at the centre.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -6..6, y -6..6, z -6..10 units (0.34 x 0.35 x 0.45 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 24.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 12 x 13 x 16 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 2\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `loop` | 0.5 | loop | flicker: the shell turns and wobbles, the core pulses, the trailing licks jitter |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_core, glow_core_y, glow_core_z, glow_heart, glow_heart_f, glow_heart_y, glow_heart_z, glow_lick0, glow_lick1, glow_lick2, glow_lick3, glow_lick4 ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"glow_core","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,-2.7,-2.7],"to":[4.5,2.7,2.7],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6.5,0.3,15.5,5.7],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[16.3,0.3,21.7,5.7],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[6.5,0.3,15.5,5.7],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[16.3,0.3,21.7,5.7],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[6.5,0.3,15.5,5.7],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[6.5,0.3,15.5,5.7],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ef15eed6-d3d7-57d4-b538-ef54436f6995"},{